      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s11-t02-drill-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "先定带标签的人数结构，再优先安排限制最强的组。"
        }
