    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s11-t02-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s11-t02-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26山东事考）为积极响应“能人返乡助振兴”号召，某村计划从预备人选中选聘4名“发展顾问”，预备人选中从事A类工作的有3人，B类2人，C类4人。已知选聘必须包含三类不同来源且C类人数不超过B类，问符合上述条件的返聘方式共有多少种？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "32"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "36"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "40"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "42"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          119
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          113
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s11-t02-drill-08-p119.webp",
            "alt": "排列组合问题（二） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第113页",
            "pdfPage": 119
